flowchart TD
    A([Start])
    --> B[Choose Create User Group]
    --> C[Enter name and description]
    --> D[Define Matching Criteria]
    --> E[Select Scope]
    --> F[Assign Roles]
    --> G{Group name unique?}

    G -- No --> H[Show validation error]
    --> C

    G -- Yes --> I[Create User Group]
    --> J[Record audit]
    --> K([User Group created])
